              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolot ijo mama ejaas inabin luka papakon, ka inabin luka totokon.” Kotema ekabaka loka Isirael ŋes atiar, “Mam; naarai anyarau EJAKAIT ikabakan lu luuni aijaikin kes akan naka Moab.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
